        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amategeko y'intambara",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nutabara kurwanya ababisha bawe, ukabona amafarashi n'amagare n'abantu babaruta ubwinshi ntuzabatinye, kuko uri kumwe n'Uwiteka Imana yawe yagukuye mu gihugu cya Egiputa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nimwigira hafi y'intambara, umutambyi azigire hafi y'abantu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ababwire ati “Nimwumve Bisirayeli, uyu munsi mwigiye hafi y'ababisha murwanya. Imitima yanyu nticogore, ntimutinye, ntimuhinde umushyitsi, ntimubakukire imitima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko Uwiteka Imana yanyu ari yo ijyana namwe ngo ibarwanire n'ababisha banyu, ibakize.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abatware bazabaze abantu bati “Ni nde uri hano wubatse inzu akaba atarayeza? Nagende asubire muri iyo nzu ye gupfira mu ntambara, undi ngo ayeze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ni nde uri hano wateye uruzabibu akaba atararya imbuto zarwo? Nagende asubire imuhira ye gupfira mu ntambara, undi ngo arye imbuto zarwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ni nde uri hano wasabye umukobwa akaba ataramurongora? Nagende asubire imuhira ye gupfira mu ntambara, undi ngo amurongore.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abatware bongere babaze abantu bati “Ni nde uri hano utinya agacogora umutima? Nagende asubire imuhira, imitima ya bene wabo ye gukuka nk'uwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatware nibamara kubwira abantu ibyo, bashyireho abatware b'ingabo bo gutabaza abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwigira hafi y'umudugudu ngo urwane na wo, uzawubwire iby'amahoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze nibagusubiza iby'amahoro bakakūgururira, abo uzasangamo bose uzabakoreshe uruharo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko nibanga gusezerana amahoro nawe, ahubwo bagashaka kurwana nawe, uzasakize uwo mudugudu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Uwiteka Imana yawe niwukugabiza, uzicishe umugabo uwurimo wese inkota, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ariko abagore n'abakobwa n'abana bato, n'amatungo n'ibiri muri uwo mudugudu byose, n'iminyago n'isahu byawo byose, ubyijyanire urye ibyo wanyaze ababisha bawe, ibyo Uwiteka Imana yawe yaguhaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azabe ari ko ugenza imidugudu ikuri kure cyane, itari iy'aya mahanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mu midugudu y'aya mahanga Uwiteka Imana yawe iguha ho gakondo, ntuzakize ikintu cyose gihumeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahubwo uzarimbure rwose ayo mahanga, ni yo Baheti n'Abamori, n'Abanyakanāni n'Abaferizi, n'Abahivi n'Abayebusi uko Uwiteka Imana yawe yagutegetse, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo batabigisha gukurikiza ibizira byabo byose bagirira imana zabo, mukaba mucumuye ku Uwiteka Imana yanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Numara igihe kirekire ugose umudugudu ukarwanira kuwutsinda, ntuzatsembeshe intorezo ibiti bya bene wo kuko byagutungisha imbuto zabyo, ntuzabice. Igiti cyo mu murima mbese na cyo ni umuntu byatuma ugitera nka wa mudugudu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icyakora ibiti uzi ko bitera imbuto ziribwa, uzabitutira ubitsembeho, ubyubakishe ibihome ku mudugudu ukurwanya ugeza aho uzawutsindira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
